  "source": "// Algebraic data types and exhaustive matching.\n// Delete the Triangle arm and press Check.\n\ntype Shape = Circle(radius: Float)\n           | Rectangle(width: Float, height: Float)\n           | Triangle(base: Float, height: Float)\n\nfunc area(s: Shape) -> Float\n    example Circle(1.0) -> 3.14159\n    example Rectangle(3.0, 4.0) -> 12.0\n    example Triangle(4.0, 5.0) -> 10.0\n    match s with\n        | Circle(r) -> return 3.14159 * r * r\n        | Rectangle(w, h) -> return w * h\n        | Triangle(b, h) -> return 0.5 * b * h\n    end match\nend func\n\nfunc total_area(shapes: List[Shape]) -> Float\n    example [Circle(1.0), Rectangle(2.0, 3.0)] -> 9.14159\n    return fold(list: shapes, initial: 0.0, reducer: fn(acc: Float, s: Shape) -> acc + area(s))\nend func\n\nfunc main() -> Float\n    return total_area([Circle(1.0), Rectangle(2.0, 3.0), Triangle(4.0, 5.0)])\nend func\n"
